# M3U bridge: divert module 31's node-action classification call
# to the hook trampoline at the base of the full build's module 31
# segment extension payload (patches/full). Same site and contract
# as the compose variant's 0040; the trampoline differs only in
# its handled exit (folder-play start, see build/src/
# asm_trampoline_ext.py).
name: 0040-m3u-browser-hook
kind: module
module: 31
region: code
address: 0x307df1a
gate: Do NOT stack alone. Requires the full build's module 31
  segment extension (--grow 31:code: with payload31.bin):
  trampoline at exec 0x0307EE48, bridge entry at 0x0307EE88.
expect: fff76df9
replace: 00f095bf
rationale: The site is the single BL inside module 31's node-action
  function that dispatches on the selected node's class byte;
  see the compose variant's 0040 for the full register
  contract. On a bridge decline the trampoline reproduces the
  displaced call exactly. On a successful import it leaves
  into the stock folder-play sequence at 0x0307E052 with
  r0 = 1, so the stock start sequence (classifier, directory
  fetch, source 6 commit, event clears, 0x14D post, message
  3) runs with the staging flag armed.
